---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy - Writings by Lala"
  description="Privacy Policy for Writings by Lala and related private tools."
>
  <article class="container-narrow policy">
    <p class="hand kicker">privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: May 27, 2026</p>

    <p>
      This website and related private tools are operated by Lala Dimalanta.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      We may collect information that you voluntarily provide, such as your
      name, email address, messages, form submissions, or other information you
      choose to send.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you connect a third-party account, such as Pinterest, we may access
      only the information you authorize through that platform. For Pinterest,
      this may include read-only access to boards, Pins, Pin titles,
      descriptions, image links, and related metadata.
    </p>

    <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
    <p>We use information to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>operate and improve this website</li>
      <li>respond to messages or requests</li>
      <li>create private content, planning, research, or creative inspiration materials</li>
      <li>maintain internal business and content workflows</li>
      <li>comply with legal, security, or platform requirements</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Pinterest data accessed through our tools is used only to create private
      inspiration briefs and visual planning materials. We do not use Pinterest
      data to impersonate users, publish content without permission, or sell
      personal information.
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing Information</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell personal information.
    </p>
    <p>
      We may share information only when needed to operate our services, comply
      with the law, protect our rights, or work with trusted service providers
      who help us run our website and tools.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Storage and Security</h2>
    <p>
      We take reasonable steps to protect information from unauthorized access,
      misuse, or disclosure. No online system is completely secure, so we
      cannot guarantee absolute security.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      This website and related tools may use third-party services, including
      Pinterest, hosting providers, analytics tools, email tools, and AI tools.
      These services may process information according to their own privacy
      policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Choices</h2>
    <p>
      You may contact us to request access, correction, or deletion of
      information you have provided. You may also disconnect third-party account
      access through that platform's account or app settings.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      This website and related tools are not directed to children under 13. We
      do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The updated version
      will be posted on this page with a new "Last updated" date.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For privacy questions, contact Lala Dimalanta at
      <a href="mailto:hello@writingsbylala.com">hello@writingsbylala.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy {
    padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
  }

  .kicker {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--ink-faded);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .policy h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .policy ul {
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .policy li {
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }
</style>
